## Pre-existing T16 stubs (NOT introduced by T15)

The repository contains two TDD stub files for Task 16 (file-management feature)
that import unimplemented modules:
- test/state/files_provider_test.dart  -> imports lib/state/files_provider.dart (missing)
- test/widget/files_page_test.dart     -> imports lib/pages/files_page.dart (missing)

These reference AgentClient methods (fetchFileRoots, fetchFiles, deleteFile,
renameFile, moveFile, uploadFile) that the production AgentClient does not yet
expose. T15 scope (audio) does not own those methods and intentionally leaves
the T16 work-in-progress alone, matching the documented "concurrent-edit
hazard" pattern from T8/T10 in learnings.md.

The 32 tests above cover all T15 scope:
- 12 AgentClient tests (URL normalization, fetchStatus error mapping)
- 6 audio controller tests (state/devices providers, setVolume/setMute/switchDevice
  invalidation, error surfacing)
- 7 connection provider tests
- 6 audio page widget tests (default-device render, slider onChangeEnd,
  mute toggle, device tap -> switchDevice, retry button, 502 message)
- 1 main widget test
